{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は\n『ライムスター宇多丸のウィークエンド・シャッフル』\nに出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず思うのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宇多丸さんが優しくていい人で良かったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に調子にのってましたけど\n今回も楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/21/3884276/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DJやりたい！できるようになりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BPM半分にスローダウン とか\nスピードアップ とかしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あってる？\nちょっとあんまりわかってないんだけど\n興味津々"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/21/3884276/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴きそびれちゃったかたは\nタイムフリーとかで聴いてみてね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムフリーって\nすごい画期的なシステムですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ラジオよく聴くようになったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、\n『WORD FREAK』ね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週は晋平太さんとMAKAさんのバトルでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週は特にかっこよかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金で使ってる\nTOKONA-Xさんの『知らざあ言って聞かせやSHOW』\nのビートを使ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に自分のやってることが\n恥ずかしいを通り越して、おぞましい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n『アルコ＆ピースD.C.GARAGE 』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが\nアルピーさんのラジオは本当に面白い！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前\n移動中の車の中でイヤホンして聴いてたら\n笑いが止まらなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもメンバーに不審に思われるのも嫌だし\n頑張って声は出さないようにしてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩の震えがおさまらず\nきいちゃんに気づかれてました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/21/3884276/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/21/3884276/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木中\n『ブランコ』放送されてたのね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知できずですみません..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のNOGIBINGO!は出演してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ！観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/21/3884276/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}